    {"Width over height, for Custom.", "自定义画面的宽高比例。"},
    {"Brightness of the finished picture, after the game's own filter.", "调整渲染完成后的画面亮度。"},
    {"Spread between the darkest and lightest tones.", "调整亮部和暗部的对比。"},
    {"Lifts or deepens the mid-tones without touching black or white.", "调整中间色调的明暗。"},
    {"Strength of colour; 0 is black and white.", "调整色彩强度，0 为黑白。"},
    {"All four back to 1.00, which skips the pass.", "将亮度、对比度、伽马和饱和度设回 1.00。"},
