    {"Which shoulder the camera looks over.", "选择镜头所在的肩侧。"},
    {"How far behind her the camera hangs.", "设置镜头与角色之间的距离。"},
    {"How high above her feet it looks from.", "设置镜头的高度。"},
    {"How far to the side of her it sits.", "设置镜头向肩侧偏移的距离。"},
    {"Vertical, in degrees.", "设置垂直视野角度。"},
    {"How fast the right stick turns it.", "设置右摇杆转动镜头的速度。"},
